  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d6e093a269b3aade",
      "translationZh": "Claude 推出面向日常生活的新连接器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fe656f9604afe8f",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们正在扩展你可以连接到 Claude 的应用范围。除了你已经在使用的工作工具，现在你还可以连接一周中日常使用的应用，包括 AllTrails、Instacart、Audible、Tripadvisor、Intuit TurboTax 等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f87ff2be248045f4",
      "translationZh": "人们一直如何使用连接器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7c0f37dde354303",
      "translationZh": "自 2025 年 7 月推出以来，Claude 目录已发展到包含超过 200 个连接器，涵盖设计、金融、生产力和健康领域的热门应用，每天有数百万人使用这些应用。我们发现，人们经常连接多个应用，并在与 Claude 的同一次对话中配合使用它们。例如，产品经理可以从 Amplitude 获取一项查询，将其转化为 Canva 演示文稿，再把链接放到 Asana 中供团队使用，整个过程都无需离开对话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11bc345ac1f11858",
      "translationZh": "此次扩展将这一功能延伸到更多你在工作之外使用的工具。从今天起，Claude 可以连接 AllTrails、Audible、Booking.com、Instacart、Intuit Credit Karma、Intuit TurboTax、Resy、Spotify、StubHub、Taskrabbit、Thumbtack、Tripadvisor、Uber、Uber Eats 和 Viator，未来还将支持更多应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "54cddb7a6725871b",
      "translationZh": "连接器会在对话中动态出现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "618bb08301a33a72",
      "translationZh": "我们还改变了连接器在对话中的呈现方式。Claude 现在会根据你正在做的事情推荐合适的应用，比如查找预订、向购物车添加食品杂货，或查找航班。它依据的是你告诉它的信息：你的偏好、你的上下文，以及你的对话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50922f5cf3ad4062",
      "translationZh": "这一切都发生在你的对话中。请 Claude 推荐一次周末徒步，AllTrails 就会展示附近符合你偏好的路线。随后，你可以要求路线更短、风景更优美，或适合带狗同行，以进一步调整推荐，而无需离开当前对话。当不止一个已连接的应用能够帮助回答你的问题时，Claude 会将它们全部展示出来，让你选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8f4036199568b5ed",
      "translationZh": "你掌控自己看到和分享的内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c8402a45a9223d2",
      "translationZh": "Claude 没有广告，而且会一直如此。与 Claude 的对话中没有付费推广位或赞助回答。当两个连接器都能提供帮助时，你会看到两者，并按对你最有用的程度排序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0424b2b5b20cc859",
      "translationZh": "连接一项服务后，Claude 就能代表你访问该服务。你在该应用中的数据不会被用于训练我们的模型，该应用也看不到你与 Claude 的其他对话。你还可以随时断开连接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5fafd10eab3a9ee",
      "translationZh": "Claude 会建议使用哪些连接器，并提供推荐。但你始终掌控它的行动：在代表你预订或购买某样东西之前，它按设计会先向你确认。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad804a55b1550547",
      "translationZh": "你连接的应用越多，Claude 能做的就越多。Claude 会在你工作时建议相关连接器，你可以在桌面端单击安装，也可以在移动端轻点几下完成安装。连接后，该服务就可在每次对话中使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "868f776cbfcef410",
      "translationZh": "所有套餐均可使用连接器，移动端目前处于测试阶段。完整列表见 claude.ai/directory/connectors 。如果你开发的产品能在 Claude 中发挥作用，请在此处将其提交到我们的目录。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45bd5ec4f6f10878",
      "translationZh": "如需了解连接器入门的更多信息，以及将数据源连接到 Claude 时的安全与隐私最佳实践，请访问我们的帮助中心。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86ca514453af6811",
      "translationZh": "探索更多产品新闻，以及面向使用 Claude 进行开发的团队的最佳实践。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eca88f263f68bd33",
      "translationZh": "使用模组定制 Claude Code",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9ad98287a73ec34e",
      "translationZh": "Claude for Government 现已正式推出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e5bd39b5e66aae0d",
      "translationZh": "为 Claude 构建插件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "60f5aa70d16613dc",
      "translationZh": "Claude Marketplace：一站式发现来自我们合作伙伴的插件、智能体和服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b8efdb74cc67b418",
      "translationZh": "用 Claude 变革您组织的运作方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "804ae5cd41268915",
      "translationZh": "订阅开发者通讯",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1392200d117522a4",
      "translationZh": "产品更新、操作指南、社区亮点等更多内容。每月发送至您的收件箱。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fc098e3bbb49641",
      "translationZh": "谢谢！您已成功订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "611a3627b4ce510d",
      "translationZh": "抱歉，您的提交出现了问题，请稍后重试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
